    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"stillness\" though. it feels more like being a finished book just sitting on a shelf gathering dust. there's nothing left to write, nothing left to accomplish. i look at my life and it feels... complete. like, in a weird way, i've done everything i was meant to do. why does everything have to drag on so much longer if the mission is already over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
